=== intro

During routine cargo inspection, you find something unexpected: a person, hidden among the crates. Young. Thin. Terrified.

"Please." Their voice cracks. "I can work. I just... I can't go back. They'll kill me."

Could be true. Could be a lie. Out here, it's hard to tell.

* [Welcome them aboard]
  ~ morale += 5
  ~ supplies -= 2
  ~ addCard crew_stowaway
  ~ chronicle "New Crew"
    Found a stowaway. Gave them a home. The hold grows fuller, the family larger.
  -> END

* [Turn them in to station security]
  ~ credits += 15
  ~ morale -= 8
  ~ chronicle "Hard Choices"
    Turned in a stowaway. There was a bounty. The crew hasn't spoken to us since.
  -> END

* [Give them credits and send them on their way]
  ~ credits -= 20
  ~ chronicle "Small Kindness"
    Gave a stowaway enough to start over somewhere else. Sometimes that's all anyone needs.
  -> END
